 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Raise one wait alert per stranded bead a live waiter is [/bold #D7AFFF]      [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]blocked on[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]stranded-bead-wait-alert[dim] · [dim][/dim]after stranded-root-members[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]stranded-bead-wait-alert: make wait_checks classify the unclosed beads [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]that live waiters block on through a targeted, TTL-cached stranded-work [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]collection, and upsert one deduplicated, self-dismissing notification [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]per stranded bead with its cause and relaunch command.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Warn or refuse when an agent targets a one-segment near-miss [/bold #D7AFFF] [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]of its assigned bead[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]assigned-bead-near-miss[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]assigned-bead-near-miss: detect, inside SASE agents, bead IDs that [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]differ from the assigned bead by one inserted or deleted non-trailing [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]segment; banner the read output, refuse close/open per the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]near_miss_mutation decision, and tighten the phase and task work [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]prompts.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Stop plan propose from parenting new epics under an [/bold #D7AFFF]          [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]already-closed bead[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]closed-parent-stamp[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]closed-parent-stamp: skip the automatic parent_bead stamp in sase plan [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]propose when the proposing agent's active bead is already closed, so [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]follow-on campaign epics are 